{"2554930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadows Are Alive", "steam_appid": 2554930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Single Player or Multiplayer up to 5 players!</u></strong><br><br>Step into the spooky world of Shadows Are Alive, where relentless suspense meets an ever-evolving survival horror. As the mansion's walls shift and secrets unravel, can you keep your wits about you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.poster.avif?t=1761525463\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.webm?t=1761525463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.mp4?t=1761525463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine: Teaming up with your friends for an adventure, <strong>you're a group of childhood heroes, exploring various locations and discovering danger.  From a haunted mansion to a spooky carnival, unpredictable at every corner</strong>. But this isn't your typical hide-and-seek. <strong>Channel the powers of your alter egos</strong>.  Whether that's a heroic <strong>firefighter</strong>, mastermind <strong>lockpicker</strong>, insightful <strong>psychologist</strong>, or the resourceful <strong>inventor</strong>. Pull on their abilities to survive the night.  What's the catch? The dark entity known as <strong>&quot;The Shift&quot;</strong> is on your tail as you try to find your way out, and this entity plays for keeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/b53bf0f71edef337eef209824de5d77a.avif?t=1761525463\" width=650 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn unveils new challenges, every strategy you devise is put to the test. Keep your lantern close, it's your line of defense against The Shift's eerie &quot;<strong>Shift Vision</strong>&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/87f755fdddc1bdfa6d7e5f81cecf780b.avif?t=1761525463\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras_big/87f755fdddc1bdfa6d7e5f81cecf780b.avif?t=1761525463 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/c7a828967e47603737d9cf75920d0fb0.avif?t=1761525463\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras_big/c7a828967e47603737d9cf75920d0fb0.avif?t=1761525463 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the cluthes of the Shift or fall to his wrath?  More maps are coming to prepare to get spooky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Playgrounds: Randomly generated maps creates fresh thrills on every play-through, challenges, and pathways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aura or Nothing: Evade The Shift who's after your glow – the very aura that defines you in this shadow-filled world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid Imagery: A game world bursting with color and character—imagine if your favorite animated movie met the coolest survival game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape-Shifting Pursuer: The Shift isn't just any foe; navigate their dual forms, both the tangible terror and its swift, smoke-like state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Team-Ups: Join forces, mix and match abilities, and strategize with friends in high-octane multiplayer sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Depths: Behind each alter ego, lies a tale waiting to be uncovered. And The Shift? Its past is shrouded in mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/e4745599b6d6f090365117d4b9e13fbe.avif?t=1761525463\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows Are Alive promises a thrilling ride that's packed with adrenaline, strategy, and mystery. So, ready for a heart-racing, time-chasing, and mind-blowing adventure?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Single Player or Multiplayer up to 5 players!</u></strong><br><br>Step into the spooky world of Shadows Are Alive, where relentless suspense meets an ever-evolving survival horror. As the mansion's walls shift and secrets unravel, can you keep your wits about you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.poster.avif?t=1761525463\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.webm?t=1761525463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/17d8fb411af0e9d5da17f92354a5f1a3.mp4?t=1761525463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine: Teaming up with your friends for an adventure, <strong>you're a group of childhood heroes, exploring various locations and discovering danger.  From a haunted mansion to a spooky carnival, unpredictable at every corner</strong>. But this isn't your typical hide-and-seek. <strong>Channel the powers of your alter egos</strong>.  Whether that's a heroic <strong>firefighter</strong>, mastermind <strong>lockpicker</strong>, insightful <strong>psychologist</strong>, or the resourceful <strong>inventor</strong>. Pull on their abilities to survive the night.  What's the catch? The dark entity known as <strong>&quot;The Shift&quot;</strong> is on your tail as you try to find your way out, and this entity plays for keeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/b53bf0f71edef337eef209824de5d77a.avif?t=1761525463\" width=650 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn unveils new challenges, every strategy you devise is put to the test. Keep your lantern close, it's your line of defense against The Shift's eerie &quot;<strong>Shift Vision</strong>&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/87f755fdddc1bdfa6d7e5f81cecf780b.avif?t=1761525463\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras_big/87f755fdddc1bdfa6d7e5f81cecf780b.avif?t=1761525463 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/c7a828967e47603737d9cf75920d0fb0.avif?t=1761525463\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras_big/c7a828967e47603737d9cf75920d0fb0.avif?t=1761525463 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the cluthes of the Shift or fall to his wrath?  More maps are coming to prepare to get spooky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Playgrounds: Randomly generated maps creates fresh thrills on every play-through, challenges, and pathways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aura or Nothing: Evade The Shift who's after your glow – the very aura that defines you in this shadow-filled world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid Imagery: A game world bursting with color and character—imagine if your favorite animated movie met the coolest survival game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape-Shifting Pursuer: The Shift isn't just any foe; navigate their dual forms, both the tangible terror and its swift, smoke-like state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Team-Ups: Join forces, mix and match abilities, and strategize with friends in high-octane multiplayer sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Depths: Behind each alter ego, lies a tale waiting to be uncovered. And The Shift? Its past is shrouded in mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/extras/e4745599b6d6f090365117d4b9e13fbe.avif?t=1761525463\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows Are Alive promises a thrilling ride that's packed with adrenaline, strategy, and mystery. So, ready for a heart-racing, time-chasing, and mind-blowing adventure?</p>", "short_description": "Enter the ever-changing world of Shadows Are Alive! Team up, channel epic alter-egos, and outwit &quot;The Shift&quot; in a series of shape-shifting maps. Relentless suspense, vibrant visuals, and unmatched strategy. Can you escape the Shift, or will you fall to his wrath?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Serbian, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Malay<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/header.jpg?t=1761525463", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/99a8fc63c9b8bd1ccba58b7f354aafe7c37b5ded/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761525463", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554930/99a8fc63c9b8bd1ccba58b7f354aafe7c37b5ded/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761525463", "website": "https://www.futuragames.co.uk/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050 / Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 or AMD equivalent (AMD FX 9500+ Series)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660, 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX Vega 56, 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements":